<p dir="auto">I started on this when reviewing <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4561862363" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44317" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/44317/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44317">#44317</a> because that wants to refer to an undocumented method I needed to understand. Talking about pulling a thread...</p>
<p dir="auto">Anyway, I believe this is correct and useful. The only thing missing is the stream equivalent of <code class="notranslate">WebTransportDatagramsWritable</code> - <code class="notranslate">WebTransportSendStream</code>.</p>]]></content>
