<p dir="auto">Clarifies the <code class="notranslate">Array.prototype.map()</code> example that uses <code class="notranslate">querySelectorAll()</code> with a <code class="notranslate">NodeList</code>.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Changes</h2>
