<h2 dir="auto">Why this helps readers</h2>
<p dir="auto">The code example creates an array; it does not render output to the page. This clarification helps beginners understand what the example actually returns and why <code class="notranslate">Array.prototype.map.call()</code> is used with a <code class="notranslate">NodeList</code>.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Testing/checks performed</h2>
